# Reset the reveal so the scene plays correctly on a replay or a reloaded save.
set {elion_name} = "Elion"
set {theo_name} = "Theo"
set {cassia_name} = "???"

narrator: Once again, Remi finished his dance beautifully, this time under Theo's amazed gaze.
narrator: Theo stared at him in disbelief, clearly impressed by what he had just witnessed.

join theo (Surprised) leftmost
theo (Surprised): Whoa-
theo (Thinking): I must admit, I had my doubts at first... but you really are good at this, Mr. Remi.
join elion (Default) right
elion (Default): Just as I expected from Sir Remi! Another wonderful performance!
join remi (Please) left
remi (Please): Squeak!
theo (Default): Then it's settled. Count me in as another member of your team.
theo (Smile): I hope we'll get along well.
elion (Smile): Thank you very much!
remi (Happy): Squeak! Squeak!!
theo (Default): So… what now?
elion (Determined): We have three members now, so we are nearly there! Let us go find the final member of our group!
theo (Thinking): Hmm…
theo (Default): And do you have any idea who that last person might be?
elion (Default): From the bottom of my heart, I can confidently say…
elion (Smile): I have absolutely no idea!
remi (Sad): …squeak…
theo (Crashout): …I see.

narrator: The three of them stood there in silence, staring at one another without a single idea coming to mind.
narrator: After a long moment, Theo was the first to speak.

theo (Thinking): ...Actually, I think I might know someone.
remi (Confused): Squeak...?
theo (Default): Before I ran into you two, I saw someone wandering around nearby.
theo (Thinking): She's incredibly quick on her feet, with sharp reflexes, perfect balance, and precise movements... Honestly, those skills would be perfect for dancing.
theo (Default): If we can convince her to join us, I think we would have a pretty good chance of winning this contest.
elion (Determined): Oh! Then we must find her at once!
theo (Thinking): Yeah... but, uh... we should probably be a little careful when we approach her.
elion (Confused): Careful?
theo (Default): Well, she can be... uhh…
theo (Crashout): Intense…?

narrator: And so, the three of them set off in search of the mysterious woman Theo had spoken of.
narrator: They searched around the nearby streets, following the direction Theo had last seen her heading.
narrator: After a short while, Theo suddenly slowed his pace and looked ahead.

theo (Default): ...There.

narrator: A red-skinned tiefling stood with her back to them, white hair shifting above a dark scarf draped like a short cloak as she quietly searched the area.
narrator: With her back turned to them, none of them could see her face.
narrator: While the group stood there in silence, Theo cautiously stepped forward.

theo: Hey, Cas-

narrator: Suddenly, in an instant, she vanished from sight.

theo (Surprised): Huh-?!

narrator: Before anyone could react, that tiefling was already behind him, a black dagger resting against his neck.

elion (Surprised): Sir Theo!!!
remi (Surprised): Squeak!!!
theo (Shocked): !!!

narrator: The mysterious tiefling paused at Theo's terrified reaction before immediately lowering her weapon.

join cassia (Intimidate) rightmost 

cassia (Intimidate): Oh- it's just you.

narrator: As if nothing had happened, the dagger vanished from sight just as quickly as it had appeared.
narrator: Standing before them now was an intimidating-looking tiefling, her eyes hidden beneath a dark blindfold.

theo (Crashout): …!!!
elion (Smile): Ah! Lady Cassia! So it really is you. We meet again!

# Elion says her name here, so the name box stops saying ??? from this point on.
set {cassia_name} = "Cassia"

remi: Squeak?!

narrator: Somehow, it seemed Elion knew this intimidating tiefling as well.
narrator: At this point, Remi was beginning to wonder just how many people Elion knew.

theo (Shocked): Uh- Umm… Ahem-!
theo (Default): Um, Mr. Remi, this is [b]Cassia[/b]. She is- well… a [b]rogue[/b] I and Elion have met from our earlier missio-
cassia (Default): State your purpose.
theo (Shocked): …!
elion (Determined): We heard that this festival is hosting a dancing contest, so we have been searching for another member to join our team!
elion (Default): There are three of us so far. If you joined us, our team would finally be complete.
cassia: Three?
elion (Smile): Yes! Sir Theo, myself, and of course, Sir Remi!
cassia (Confused): …
cassia: Who the hell is Remi?
elion (Surprised): Oh! Pardon me. I completely forgot to introduce him.

narrator: Elion enthusiastically knelt beside Remi and gestured toward him.

elion (Smile): This is Sir Remi, the finest dancer I have ever had the honor of witnessing!
remi (Happy): Squeak!
cassia (Disapproved): …
cassia (Default): I am going to ignore the fact that you can apparently talk to a rat and move on.
theo (Crashout): (!!! Thank god. I'm not the only one wondering how the hell Elion can understand a rat!!!)
cassia: So you came all this way just to ask if I would join a dancing contest?
theo (Default): ...Exactly.
elion (Default): With your remarkable speed and precision, I am certain you would be a great addition to our-
cassia: I refuse.
remi (Surprised): Squeak?!!
cassia: I have no interest in wasting my time on some dancing contest.
cassia (Mocking): Besides, a team led by a rat? You cannot be serious.
remi (Sad): Squeak…
elion (Sad): Lady Cassia! There is no need to speak of Sir Remi that way.
cassia (Intimidate): I'll speak however I please, don't tell me what to do.
elion: Lady Cassia, please reconsider.
elion: Sir Remi has worked very hard for this opportunity. I truly believe he deserves a chance.
remi (Please): Squeak…
cassia (Surprised): And why should that matter to me?
theo (Thinking): U-Um... maybe…
theo (Default): Maybe you could watch him dance first…?
cassia (Intimidate): …What?
theo (Shocked): J-Just once! Then you can decide after that.
theo (Crashout): (Please…! For my research fund…!)
cassia (Disapproved): Hm…
elion: Please, Lady Cassia.
theo (Default): Y- Yes! Please…
remi (Please): Squeak!
cassia (Default): …
cassia: If this rat is really as good as you two claim, then prove it to me.
cassia: Impress me, and I might reconsider joining this little team of yours.
remi (Happy): Squeak!

narrator: Remi stepped forward without hesitation, determined to prove himself once again.
narrator: Cassia folded her arms and stood silently, waiting to see if it was truly worth her time.

cassia (Intimidate): Go on, rat. Show me what you can do.

narrator: With Elion and Theo watching closely behind him, Remi took his place and prepared to dance.